OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786241893
OL,3,CBritish aid charity investigated over
OL,4,Calleged links to Hamas
OL,6,FAn UK-based international aid charity
OL,7,Fis facing a probe by counter terror
OL,8,Fpolice and the charity watchdog over
OL,9,Falleged links to Hamas.
OL,11,FMohammad Yousef Hasna, 45, from
OL,12,FIstanbul, Turkey, was arrested in the
OL,13,FUK last week accused of conspiring to
OL,14,Ffunnel money and supplies to Hamas
OL,15,Fthrough his senior role in what
OL,16,Fprosecutors say was a sham global
OL,17,Fhumanitarian organisation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
