OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786241893
OL,3,CBritish aid charity investigated over
OL,4,Calleged links to Hamas
OL,6,FHasna is being held pending
OL,7,Fextradition proceedings before he can
OL,8,Fbe taken to New York to face charges
OL,9,Fbrought by the US.
OL,11,FThe Charity Commission has launched an
OL,12,Finquiry into the Al-Khair Foundation,
OL,13,Fa Muslim faith UK-based charity
OL,14,Fpurported to be providing emergency
OL,15,Frelief and developmental support
OL,16,Faround the world.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
