FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786241893
OL,3,CBritish aid charity investigated over
OL,4,Calleged links to Hamas
OL,6,FCounter Terror Policing London (CTP)
OL,7,Falso confirmed they are investigating
OL,8,Fthe foundation and carried out two
OL,9,Fsearch warrants on addresses in
OL,10,FCroydon on Friday, July 31, but have
OL,11,Fnot made any arrests.
OL,13,FPolice confirmed they were working
OL,14,Fwith the charity commission, and were
OL,15,Faware of the arrest of Hasna by the US
OL,16,Fauthorities.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
