FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786241893
OL,3,CBritish aid charity investigated over
OL,4,Calleged links to Hamas
OL,6,FThe Charity Commission investigation
OL,7,Fintends to find out the extent of the
OL,8,FAl-Khair Foundation's links with Hasna
OL,9,Fand whether trustees are carrying out
OL,10,Fdue diligence on partners and use of
OL,11,Ffunds.
OL,13,FThe foundation said it is "co-
OL,14,Foperating fully" with the inquiry and
OL,15,Fhad already filed a serious incident
OL,16,Freport with the watchdog before it was
OL,17,Flaunched.
OL,26,@uD@[OUvD@PO]
