OL,3,CBritish aid charity investigated over
OL,4,Calleged links to Hamas
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the foundation
OL,7,Fsaid: "Everywhere we work we are
OL,8,Ffirmly committed to ensuring that the
OL,9,Ffunds entrusted to us by our generous
OL,10,Fdonors are used for their intended
OL,11,Fpurpose: meeting the humanitarian
OL,12,Fneeds of poor and marginalised people
OL,13,Fin the communities we serve.
OL,15,F"Al-Khair Foundation is deeply
OL,16,Fcommitted to supporting those in need
OL,17,Fin Gaza.
OL,26,@oD@GOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
