PN,31506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786241893
OL,3,CBritish aid charity investigated over
OL,4,Calleged links to Hamas
OL,6,F"Our significant support over many
OL,7,Fyears has included providing food
OL,8,Fparcels, hot meals, clean water,
OL,9,Fmedical aid, shelter materials, winter
OL,10,Fassistance and orphan and family
OL,11,Fsupport."
OL,13,FThe foundation also maintains that
OL,14,FHasna is not an employee but works
OL,15,Fwith one of its global partners to
OL,16,Fenable the delivery of aid around the
OL,17,Fworld.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@IO]
