CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786241893
OL,3,CBritish aid charity investigated over
OL,4,Calleged links to Hamas
OL,6,FUS lawyer Jamie McDonald in New York
OL,7,Falleged Hasna worked closely with
OL,8,FHamas' senior leadership to deliver
OL,9,Fsupplies, food and funding to Hamas
OL,10,Funder the guise of humanitarian aid.
OL,12,FBoth the US and the UK have designated
OL,13,FHamas a terrorist organisation.
OL,15,FThe Al-Khair Foundation recorded an
OL,16,Fincome of more than #74 million in the
OL,17,Ffinancial year ending July 31 2025,
OL,18,Fthe watchdog said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
