OL,3,CBritish aid charity investigated over
OL,4,Calleged links to Hamas
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FA Charity Commission statement
OL,12,Fpublished on Friday said: "Last month
OL,13,Fthe commission received a complaint
OL,14,Falleging the charity and its partners
OL,15,Fhad connections to Hamas, a proscribed
OL,16,Fterrorist organisation.
OL,26,@tD@[OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786241893
OL,3,CBritish aid charity investigated over
OL,4,Calleged links to Hamas
OL,6,F"It also alleged the charity had
OL,7,Ffunded the organisation. The regulator
OL,8,Fimmediately started examining the
OL,9,Fserious concerns raised and gathered
OL,10,Fmore information to inform its
OL,11,Fassessment. The commission has now
OL,12,Fescalated its engagement to a
OL,13,Fstatutory inquiry."
OL,15,FA CTP spokesperson said: "The FBI are
OL,16,Fleading the investigation in relation
OL,17,Fto that individual, although CTP
OL,18,FLondon remain in contact with
OL,19,Fcolleagues in the US over this matter."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@SO]wD@ZOU{D@gO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
