FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786241893
OL,3,CBritish aid charity investigated over
OL,4,Calleged links to Hamas
OL,6,FAl-Khair is also subject to a legal
OL,7,Forder restricting some financial
OL,8,Ftransactions being made without the
OL,9,Fconsent of the Charity Commission.
OL,11,FThe charges lodged against Hasna
OL,12,Finclude conspiring to provide material
OL,13,Fsupport to Hamas, conspiring to
OL,14,Ffinance terrorism and financing
OL,15,Fterrorism. Each charge carries a
OL,16,Fmaximum penalty of 20 years in prison.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/10
